# Headcount and Payroll Analysis

## 📝 Project Overview

This Excel and Power BI project analyzes workforce-related costs across departments, including salary distribution, headcount trends, and cost-per-employee metrics.

## 🔧 Tools & Skills Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Power BI (DAX, data visualization)
- HR data analytics
- Trend and ratio analysis

## 📈 Key Features
- Headcount by month and department
- Salary cost trends
- Average cost per employee
- Gender and role distribution (if applicable)

## 💡 Business Insight

The analysis helps HR and finance teams align workforce planning with budget goals, identify cost-saving opportunities, and support diversity and equity reviews.
